WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:13,880
Although my blue-flowered tang wolf has the talent of the third ring, I have the talent of the fourth ring.

2
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:16,880
Your little fox is no match

3
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:22,790
Blue Flower Tang Lang Sanjie Insect Spiritual Beast

4
00:00:22,790 --> 00:00:24,790
But you are too disguised as a blue-flowered tiger cub to stack up your weapons

5
00:00:24,790 --> 00:00:28,790
The talent of the Four Rings is like a sickle cutting through the wind

6
00:00:28,790 --> 00:00:47,270
Let's see how you hide

7
00:00:47,270 --> 00:01:02,180
The snow witch is afraid of Kong Bianwei

8
00:01:02,180 --> 00:01:18,120
Are you still fighting?
